impleReference_rds", "argument": null, "type": "data", "label": "Simple refinement raster (reference year)", "help": "Path to an .rds file containing the packed (terra::wrap) dasymetric refinement output raster from the 'simple' refinement type, for the reference year (2021). (URL must be stored in a .txt file)", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": true, "optional": false, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": null, "extensions": ["txt"], "edam": {"edam_formats": ["format_2330"], "edam_data": ["data_0006"]}, "multiple": false, "tag": null, "options": {"dce": [], "ldda": [], "hda": [], "hdca": []}, "pinned": {"dce": [], "ldda": [], "hda": [], "hdca": []}, "options_meta": {}}, {"model_class": "DataToolParameter", "name": "inputFile3_censusgrid_rds", "argument": null, "type": "data", "label": "Census grid", "help": "Path to an .rds file containing the Eurostat census grid with observed population (column 'TOT_P_2021'), used as ground truth for evaluation. (URL must be stored in a .txt file)", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": true, "optional": false, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": null, "extensions": ["txt"], "edam": {"edam_formats": ["format_2330"], "edam_data": ["data_0006"]}, "multiple": false, "tag": null, "options": {"dce": [], "ldda": [], "hda": [], "hdca": []}, "pinned": {"dce": [], "ldda": [], "hda": [], "hdca": []}, "options_meta": {}}, {"model_class": "DataToolParameter", "name": "inputFile4_corineCLC_rds", "argument": null, "type": "data", "label": "CORINE CLC raster", "help": "Path to an .rds file containing the CORINE Land Cover raster (SpatRaster), used to derive the subset overlapping populated census grid cells. (URL must be stored in a .txt file)", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": true, "optional": false, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": null, "extensions": ["txt"], "edam": {"edam_formats": ["format_2330"], "edam_data": ["data_0006"]}, "multiple": false, "tag": null, "options": {"dce": [], "ldda": [], "hda": [], "hdca": []}, "pinned": {"dce": [], "ldda": [], "hda": [], "hdca": []}, "options_meta": {}}]}, {"model_class": "ConditionalWhen", "value": "filter-clip-clean-extent", "inputs": [{"model_class": "DataToolParameter", "name": "inputFile1_gpkg", "argument": null, "type": "data", "label": "NUTS3 regions", "help": "EU NUTS3 regions saved in geopackage. It should be in same coordinate system as the inputted river catchment dataset and overlap this - ideally it should fully contain its extent. (URL must be stored in a .txt file)", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": true, "optional": false, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": null, "extensions": ["txt"], "edam": {"edam_formats": ["format_2330"], "edam_data": ["data_0006"]}, "multiple": false, "tag": null, "options": {"dce": [], "ldda": [], "hda": [], "hdca": []}, "pinned": {"dce": [], "ldda": [], "hda": [], "hdca": []}, "options_meta": {}}, {"model_class": "TextToolParameter", "name": "inputFile2_gpkg", "argument": null, "type": "text", "label": "LAU regions.", "help": "EU LAU (Local Areal Unit) regions saved in geopackage. It should be in same coordinate system as the other inputted datasets and overlap these - ideally fully contained in the extent of the inputted river catchment dataset.", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": false, "optional": false, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": "", "area": false, "datalist": []}, {"model_class": "TextToolParameter", "name": "inputFile3_gpkg", "argument": null, "type": "text", "label": "Validated river catchments dataset", "help": "River catchments dataset stored as geopackage and already validated. An example could be EU Ecrins subcatchments from 2012. It should have the same coordinate system as the inputted NUTS3 dataset and overlap this - ideally it should fully be within its extent.", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": false, "optional": false, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": "", "area": false, "datalist": []}]}, {"model_class": "ConditionalWhen", "value": "get-analysis-extent", "inputs": [{"model_class": "DataToolParameter", "name": "inputFile1_lauFocusSelected_rds", "argument": null, "type": "data", "label": "LAU polygons in catchment (focus year)", "help": "Path to an .rds file containing the LAU (Local Administrative Unit) polygons selected within the catchment for the focus year. (URL must be stored in a .txt file)", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": true, "optional": false, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": null, "extensions": ["txt"], "edam": {"edam_formats": ["format_2330"], "edam_data": ["data_0006"]}, "multiple": false, "tag": null, "options": {"dce": [], "ldda": [], "hda": [], "hdca": []}, "pinned": {"dce": [], "ldda": [], "hda": [], "hdca": []}, "options_meta": {}}, {"model_class": "DataToolParameter", "name": "inputFile2_lauReferenceSelected_rds", "argument": null, "type": "data", "label": "LAU polygons in catchment (reference year)", "help": "Path to an .rds file containing the LAU (Local Administrative Unit) polygons selected within the catchment for the reference year, used as a fallback if no focus-year LAU polygons are found. (URL must be stored in a .txt file)", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": true, "optional": false, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": null, "extensions": ["txt"], "edam": {"edam_formats": ["format_2330"], "edam_data": ["data_0006"]}, "multiple": false, "tag": null, "options": {"dce": [], "ldda": [], "hda": [], "hdca": []}, "pinned": {"dce": [], "ldda": [], "hda": [], "hdca": []}, "options_meta": {}}]}, {"model_class": "ConditionalWhen", "value": "get-census-grid", "inputs": [{"model_class": "DataToolParameter", "name": "inputFile1_countries_rds", "argument": null, "type": "data", "label": "Countries for catchment", "help": "Path to an .rds file containing the list of country codes (matching GISCO's CNTR_ID values) for which to fetch the census grid. (URL must be stored in a .txt file)", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": true, "optional": false, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": null, "extensions": ["txt"], "edam": {"edam_formats": ["format_2330"], "edam_data": ["data_0006"]}, "multiple": false, "tag": null, "options": {"dce": [], "ldda": [], "hda": [], "hdca": []}, "pinned": {"dce": [], "ldda": [], "hda": [], "hdca": []}, "options_meta": {}}]}, {"model_class": "ConditionalWhen", "value": "get-corineCLC", "inputs": [{"model_class": "DataToolParameter", "name": "inputFile1_focusYear_rds", "argument": null, "type": "data", "label": "Population focus year", "help": "Path to an .rds file containing the focus year for population data as a single value, used to determine which CORINE CLC release year to fetch. Allowed years are 2011 through 2024. (URL must be stored in a .txt file)", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": true, "optional": false, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": null, "extensions": ["txt"], "edam": {"edam_formats": ["format_2330"], "edam_data": ["data_0006"]}, "multiple": false, "tag": null, "options": {"dce": [], "ldda": [], "hda": [], "hdca": []}, "pinned": {"dce": [], "ldda": [], "hda": [], "hdca": []}, "options_meta": {}}]}, {"model_class": "ConditionalWhen", "value": "get-ecrins-catchment", "inputs": [{"model_class": "IntegerToolParameter", "name": "catchment_id", "argument": null, "type": "integer", "label": "Catchment ID", "help": "The ECRINS functional elementary catchment ID to retrieve. Must be an integer from 1 to 118.", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": false, "min": 1, "max": 118, "optional": false, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": "0", "area": false, "datalist": []}]}, {"model_class": "ConditionalWhen", "value": "get-eubucco-buildings", "inputs": [{"model_class": "DataToolParameter", "name": "inputFile1_catchment_gpkg", "argument": null, "type": "data", "label": "Catchment boundary", "help": "Path to a .gpkg file containing the catchment (or other area of interest) polygon used to find overlapping NUTS2 regions and clip the returned buildings. (URL must be stored in a .txt file)", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": true, "optional": false, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": null, "extensions": ["txt"], "edam": {"edam_formats": ["format_2330"], "edam_data": ["data_0006"]}, "multiple": false, "tag": null, "options": {"dce": [], "ldda": [], "hda": [], "hdca": []}, "pinned": {"dce": [], "ldda": [], "hda": [], "hdca": []}, "options_meta": {}}, {"model_class": "DataToolParameter", "name": "inputFile2_countriesForCatchment_rds", "argument": null, "type": "data", "label": "Countries overlapping catchment", "help": "Path to an .rds file containing the list of country codes overlapping the catchment, used to restrict the NUTS2 region search. (URL must be stored in a .txt file)", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": true, "optional": false, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": null, "extensions": ["txt"], "edam": {"edam_formats": ["format_2330"], "edam_data": ["data_0006"]}, "multiple": false, "tag": null, "options": {"dce": [], "ldda": [], "hda": [], "hdca": []}, "pinned": {"dce": [], "ldda": [], "hda": [], "hdca": []}, "options_meta": {}}]}, {"model_class": "ConditionalWhen", "value": "get-hydro90m-catchment-by-id-gisco", "inputs": [{"model_class": "IntegerToolParameter", "name": "basin_id", "argument": null, "type": "integer", "label": "Basin ID", "help": "The Hydrography90m basin_id to retrieve (e.g. 1288419). Must be a positive integer; existence is validated live against the pygeoapi service, not against a fixed list.", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": false, "min": 1, "max": null, "optional": false, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": "0", "area": false, "datalist": []}]}, {"model_class": "ConditionalWhen", "value": "get-hydrobasins-l7-catchment", "inputs": [{"model_class": "TextToolParameter", "name": "catchment_id", "argument": null, "type": "text", "label": "Catchment ID", "help": "The HydroBASINS level 07 HYBAS_ID to retrieve (10-digit Pfafstetter-based identifier, e.g. 2070104700). Must be one of the known level 07 catchment IDs with at least some EU territory; catchments entirely outside the EU are not available.", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": false, "optional": false, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": "", "area": false, "datalist": []}]}, {"model_class": "ConditionalWhen", "value": "get-lau-data", "inputs": [{"model_class": "DataToolParameter", "name": "inputFile1_countries_rds", "argument": null, "type": "data", "label": "Countries for catchment", "help": "Path to an .rds file containing the list of country codes for which to fetch LAU population data. (URL must be stored in a .txt file)", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": true, "optional": false, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": null, "extensions": ["txt"], "edam": {"edam_formats": ["format_2330"], "edam_data": ["data_0006"]}, "multiple": false, "tag": null, "options": {"dce": [], "ldda": [], "hda": [], "hdca": []}, "pinned": {"dce": [], "ldda": [], "hda": [], "hdca": []}, "options_meta": {}}, {"model_class": "SelectToolParameter", "name": "focus_year", "argument": null, "type": "select", "label": "Focus year", "help": "The year for which to fetch LAU population data. Allowed years are 2011 through 2024.", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": false, "optional": false, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": "2011", "options": [["2011", "2011", false], ["2012", "2012", false], ["2013", "2013", false], ["2014", "2014", false], ["2015", "2015", false], ["2016", "2016", false], ["2017", "2017", false], ["2018", "2018", false], ["2019", "2019", false], ["2020", "2020", false], ["2021", "2021", false], ["2022", "2022", false], ["2023", "2023", false], ["2024", "2024", false]], "display": null, "multiple": false, "textable": false}]}, {"model_class": "ConditionalWhen", "value": "heat1", "inputs": [{"model_class": "SelectToolParameter", "name": "assessment_period", "argument": null, "type": "select", "label": "Assessment Period", "help": "The HOLAS assessment period which is used for the HEAT analysis. It can be HOLAS-2 (2011-2016) or HOLAS-3 (2016-2021) or custom for whole monitoring period (1877-9999). Note that assessment period defines the indicators used and integrations rules, where as the sample data needs to be defined separately. Allowed values: HOLAS-2, HOLAS-3, Other.", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": false, "optional": false, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": "HOLAS-2", "options": [["HOLAS-2", "HOLAS-2", false], ["HOLAS-3", "HOLAS-3", false], ["Other", "Other", false]], "display": null, "multiple": false, "textable": false}]}, {"model_class": "ConditionalWhen", "value": "heat1advanced", "inputs": [{"model_class": "DataToolParameter", "name": "spatial_units", "argument": null, "type": "data", "label": "Spatial Units", "help": "Please provide the spatial units you would like to grid, as vector data/polygons. Each unit must have a UnitID. Please provide a URL to the layer as a shapefile, or possibly other vector formats such as GeoJSON or gpkg, if implemented. (URL must be stored in a .txt file)", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": true, "optional": false, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": null, "extensions": ["txt"], "edam": {"edam_formats": ["format_2330"], "edam_data": ["data_0006"]}, "multiple": false, "tag": null, "options": {"dce": [], "ldda": [], "hda": [], "hdca": []}, "pinned": {"dce": [], "ldda": [], "hda": [], "hdca": []}, "options_meta": {}}, {"model_class": "DataToolParameter", "name": "grid_size_table", "argument": null, "type": "data", "label": "Table of Grid Sizes", "help": "Table with a grid cell size (GridSize) for each UnitID present in the input layer, to compute grid cells of the specified size. For example, 30000, 60000 and 90000 are originally used by HELCOM for the HOLAS assessment. Please provide a URL to the table as a CSV file. (URL must be stored in a .txt file)", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": true, "optional": false, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": null, "extensions": ["txt"], "edam": {"edam_formats": ["format_2330"], "edam_data": ["data_0006"]}, "multiple": false, "tag": null, "options": {"dce": [], "ldda": [], "hda": [], "hdca": []}, "pinned": {"dce": [], "ldda": [], "hda": [], "hdca": []}, "options_meta": {}}]}, {"model_class": "ConditionalWhen", "value": "heat2", "inputs": [{"model_class": "SelectToolParameter", "name": "assessment_period", "argument": null, "type": "select", "label": "Assessment Period", "help": "The HOLAS assessment period which is used for the HEAT analysis. It can be HOLAS-2 (2011-2016) or HOLAS-3 (2016-2021) or custom for whole monitoring period (1877-9999). Note that assessment period defines the indicators used and integrations rules, where as the sample data needs to be defined separately. Allowed values: HOLAS-2, HOLAS-3, Other.", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": false, "optional": false, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": "holas-2", "options": [["holas-2", "holas-2", false], ["holas-3", "holas-3", false], ["Other", "Other", false]], "display": null, "multiple": false, "textable": false}, {"model_class": "TextToolParameter", "name": "bottle_data", "argument": null, "type": "text", "label": "Input samples (bottle)", "help": "In-situ bottle sample data (nutrients, chl-a)(StationSamplesBOT.csv). ICES Oceanographic data type 'BOT'. Write 'default' for default data. Leave out for none at all.", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": false, "optional": true, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": null, "area": false, "datalist": []}, {"model_class": "TextToolParameter", "name": "ctd_data", "argument": null, "type": "text", "label": "Input samples (CTD)", "help": " CTD depth profiles, relevant for oxygen debt indicator (StationSamplesCTD.csv). ICES Oceanographic data type 'CTD'. Write 'default' for default data. Leave out for none at all.", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": false, "optional": true, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": null, "area": false, "datalist": []}, {"model_class": "TextToolParameter", "name": "pump_data", "argument": null, "type": "text", "label": "Input samples (pump)", "help": "Ferrybox data (chl-a) (StationSamplesPMP.csv). ICES Oceanographic data type 'PMP'. Write 'default' for default data. Leave out for none at all.", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": false, "optional": true, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": null, "area": false, "datalist": []}, {"model_class": "DataToolParameter", "name": "units_gridded", "argument": null, "type": "data", "label": "Gridded assessment units", "help": "Grid used for confidence assessment (10k, 30k, 60k). These are generated by heat1. For default spatial units for each assessment period, write 'default'. (URL must be stored in a .txt file)", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": true, "optional": false, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": null, "extensions": ["txt"], "edam": {"edam_formats": ["format_2330"], "edam_data": ["data_0006"]}, "multiple": false, "tag": null, "options": {"dce": [], "ldda": [], "hda": [], "hdca": []}, "pinned": {"dce": [], "ldda": [], "hda": [], "hdca": []}, "options_meta": {}}]}, {"model_class": "ConditionalWhen", "value": "heat2advanced", "inputs": [{"model_class": "DataToolParameter", "name": "units_gridded", "argument": null, "type": "data", "label": "Gridded assessment units", "help": "Grid to be used for filtering the samples. Has to be in CRS ETRS89-extended / LAEA Europe (EPSG3035. Please provide a URL to the layer as a shapefile. (URL must be stored in a .txt file)", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": true, "optional": false, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": null, "extensions": ["txt"], "edam": {"edam_formats": ["format_2330"], "edam_data": ["data_0006"]}, "multiple": false, "tag": null, "options": {"dce": [], "ldda": [], "hda": [], "hdca": []}, "pinned": {"dce": [], "ldda": [], "hda": [], "hdca": []}, "options_meta": {}}, {"model_class": "TextToolParameter", "name": "bottle_data", "argument": null, "type": "text", "label": "Input samples (bottle)", "help": "In-situ bottle sample data (nutrients, chl-a)(StationSamplesBOT.csv), ICES Oceanographic data type 'BOT'. Ideally downloaded from the ICES portal. Omit this parameter if you do not want to include bottle data. Please provide a URL to the table as a CSV file.", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": false, "optional": true, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": null, "area": false, "datalist": []}, {"model_class": "TextToolParameter", "name": "ctd_data", "argument": null, "type": "text", "label": "Input samples (CTD)", "help": "CTD depth profiles, relevant for oxygen debt indicator (StationSamplesCTD.csv). ICES Oceanographic data type 'CTD'. Ideally downloaded from the ICES portal. Omit this parameter if you do not want to include CTD data. Please provide a URL to the table as a CSV file.", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": false, "optional": true, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": null, "area": false, "datalist": []}, {"model_class": "TextToolParameter", "name": "pump_data", "argument": null, "type": "text", "label": "Input samples (pump)", "help": "Ferrybox data (chl-a) (StationSamplesPMP.csv). ICES Oceanographic data type 'PMP'. Ideally downloaded from the ICES portal. Omit this parameter if you do not want to include pump/ferrybox data. Please provide a URL to the table as a CSV file.", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": false, "optional": true, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": null, "area": false, "datalist": []}]}, {"model_class": "ConditionalWhen", "value": "heat3", "inputs": [{"model_class": "SelectToolParameter", "name": "assessment_period", "argument": null, "type": "select", "label": "Assessment Period", "help": "The HOLAS assessment period which is used for the HEAT analysis. It can be HOLAS-2 (2011-2016) or HOLAS-3 (2016-2021) or custom for whole monitoring period (1877-9999). Note that assessment period defines the indicators used and integrations rules, where as the sample data needs to be defined separately. Allowed values: HOLAS-2, HOLAS-3, Other.", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": false, "optional": false, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": "HOLAS-2", "options": [["HOLAS-2", "HOLAS-2", false], ["HOLAS-3", "HOLAS-3", false], ["Other", "Other", false]], "display": null, "multiple": false, "textable": false}, {"model_class": "DataToolParameter", "name": "station_samples", "argument": null, "type": "data", "label": "Station samples (combined)", "help": "Merged sample data of BOT, PMP and CTD data for indicator calculation (StationSamples.csv). (URL must be stored in a .txt file)", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": true, "optional": false, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": null, "extensions": ["txt"], "edam": {"edam_formats": ["format_2330"], "edam_data": ["data_0006"]}, "multiple": false, "tag": null, "options": {"dce": [], "ldda": [], "hda": [], "hdca": []}, "pinned": {"dce": [], "ldda": [], "hda": [], "hdca": []}, "options_meta": {}}, {"model_class": "BooleanToolParameter", "name": "combined_Chlorophylla_IsWeighted", "argument": null, "type": "boolean", "label": "Chlorophyll A Weighted?", "help": "If true, script calculates combined chlorophyll a indicator results per assessment unit as a weighted average from BOT, PMP and EO. If false, then simple average.", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": false, "optional": false, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": false, "truevalue": "True", "falsevalue": "False"}, {"model_class": "DataToolParameter", "name": "units_cleaned", "argument": null, "type": "data", "label": "Non-gridded assessment units", "help": "Non-gridded Assessment units which were cleaned, slightly adapted (e.g. some stations added manually), and extended (e.g. with the units's area and a UnitID). (URL must be stored in a .txt file)", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": true, "optional": false, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": null, "extensions": ["txt"], "edam": {"edam_formats": ["format_2330"], "edam_data": ["data_0006"]}, "multiple": false, "tag": null, "options": {"dce": [], "ldda": [], "hda": [], "hdca": []}, "pinned": {"dce": [], "ldda": [], "hda": [], "hdca": []}, "options_meta": {}}]}, {"model_class": "ConditionalWhen", "value": "heat3advanced", "inputs": [{"model_class": "DataToolParameter", "name": "station_samples", "argument": null, "type": "data", "label": "Station samples (filtered, combined)", "help": "Merged sample data of BOT, PMP and CTD data for indicator calculation (StationSamples.csv). (URL must be stored in a .txt file)", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": true, "optional": false, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": null, "extensions": ["txt"], "edam": {"edam_formats": ["format_2330"], "edam_data": ["data_0006"]}, "multiple": false, "tag": null, "options": {"dce": [], "ldda": [], "hda": [], "hdca": []}, "pinned": {"dce": [], "ldda": [], "hda": [], "hdca": []}, "options_meta": {}}, {"model_class": "BooleanToolParameter", "name": "combined_Chlorophylla_IsWeighted", "argument": null, "type": "boolean", "label": "Chlorophyll A Weighted?", "help": "If true, the script calculates combined chlorophyll A indicator results per assessment unit as a weighted average from BOT, PMP and EO. If false, then simple average.", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": false, "optional": false, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": false, "truevalue": "True", "falsevalue": "False"}, {"model_class": "TextToolParameter", "name": "table_indicators", "argument": null, "type": "text", "label": "Table of Indicators", "help": "A table listing the indicators. Needs the following column names: IndicatorID; CriteriaID; Name; Code; Parameters; Units; YearMin; YearMax; MonthMin; MonthMax; DepthMin; DepthMax; Metric; Response; Applied; Comments; GTC_HM; GTC_ML; STC_HM; STC_ML; SSC_HM; SSC_ML (please ask HELCOM for details). Please provide a URL to the table as a CSV file.", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": false, "optional": true, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": null, "area": false, "datalist": []}, {"model_class": "TextToolParameter", "name": "table_indicator_units", "argument": null, "type": "text", "label": "Table of Indicator Units", "help": "A table listing something about the indicators. Needs the following column names: IndicatorID; UnitID; ET; ACDEV; EQR_HG; EQR_GM; EQR_MP; EQR_PB; IW. Please ask HELCOM for details. Please provide a URL to the table as a CSV file.", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": false, "optional": true, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": null, "area": false, "datalist": []}, {"model_class": "TextToolParameter", "name": "table_indicator_unit_results", "argument": null, "type": "text", "label": "table_indicator_unit_results", "help": "A table listing something about the indicators. Needs the following column names: IndicatorID; UnitID; Period; ES; SD; N; NM; EQR; EQRS; GTC; STC; SSC. Please ask HELCOM for details. Please provide a URL to the table as a CSV file.", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": false, "optional": true, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": null, "area": false, "datalist": []}, {"model_class": "DataToolParameter", "name": "spatial_units", "argument": null, "type": "data", "label": "units_cleaned.shp", "help": "Non-Gridded spatial units, as a shapefile, used for this process. Please provide a URL to the layer as a zipped shapefile. (URL must be stored in a .txt file)", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": true, "optional": false, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": null, "extensions": ["txt"], "edam": {