alysis area in focus and have same coordinate system as the Census Grid input.", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": false, "optional": false, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": "", "area": false, "datalist": []}, {"model_class": "TextToolParameter", "name": "inputFile2_gpkg", "argument": null, "type": "text", "label": "Eurostat 2021 Census Grid in 1 km2 resolution", "help": "Eurostat 2021 Census Grid in 1 km2 resoultion as geopackage. It should cover the analysis area in focus and have same coordinate system as the Corine CLC raster input.", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": false, "optional": false, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": "", "area": false, "datalist": []}, {"model_class": "TextToolParameter", "name": "inputFile3_dbf", "argument": null, "type": "text", "label": "CORINE CLC class legend as DBF", "help": "CORINE CLC class legend stored as DBF table. It should contain the column called CODE_18 containing the CLC class IDs. It should be named the same as", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": false, "optional": false, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": "", "area": false, "datalist": []}]}], "test_param": {"model_class": "SelectToolParameter", "name": "select_process", "argument": null, "type": "select", "label": "Select process", "help": "", "help_format": "html", "refresh_on_change": true, "optional": false, "hidden": false, "is_dynamic": false, "value": "attach-legend-to-corineCLC", "options": [["attach-legend-to-corineCLC: Attach legend to CORINE CLC raster", "attach-legend-to-corineCLC", false], ["barplot-trend-results: Visualisation of statistical analysis results", "barplot-trend-results", false], ["calculate-weighting: Calculate dasymetric weighting table", "calculate-weighting", false], ["check-names: Check species names in biodiversity data from separate sources", "check-names", false], ["clean-catchment-geometry: Validate geometries (e.g. river catchments)", "clean-catchment-geometry", 